Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs once the player interacts: when the sword gains a parent it was pulled (child, stop drawing) or placed (adult, draw it), then hands off to the light-fade action; otherwise it offers itself as the interact-range actor.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Toki_Swd/z_bg_toki_swd.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
